---
description: Frontend UI rules for TailAdmin SaaS screens
alwaysApply: true
---

Reuse PageHeader, EntityHeader, Card, Dialog, DataTable, StatusBadge, EmptyState, ErrorState, LoadingState, Button, Input, and Select.

Do not create a second visual system, wizard primitive library, or duplicate metric/status components.

Keep client create identity separate from Configure services. Activation is a deliberate final action.

Preserve entered wizard values between steps. Show estimated pricing before activation.

Mark new inferred screens as pending Figma verification. Do not claim pixel-perfect Figma matches.
